OL,3,AUK signs #8bn deal to ensure submarines
OL,4,Aare 'warfighting ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK has signed an #8bn contract to
OL,7,Fupgrade its nuclear submarine fleet,
OL,8,Fwhich Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,9,Fsaid would help get the country
OL,10,F"warfighting ready".
OL,12,FThe five-year deal, awarded to defence
OL,13,Ffirm Babcock, will create 3,000 new
OL,14,Fjobs and around 2,500 apprentice and
OL,15,Fgraduate roles mainly across Plymouth,
OL,16,FClyde and Bristol, the MoD said.
OL,18,FIt will allow the Royal Navy to "work
OL,19,Faround the clock to get our submarines
OL,20,Fback out to sea" and see naval base
OL,21,Fservices modernised, Defence Secretary
OL,22,FWes Streeting told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
