OL,3,AUK signs #8bn deal to ensure submarines
OL,4,Aare 'warfighting ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said it
OL,7,Fdemonstrated his commitment to "keeping
OL,8,Fthe public safe" and "providing
OL,9,Fopportunities to "get young people into
OL,10,Fwork".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
