OL,3,ADR Congo demands answers over Ugandan
OL,4,Ageneral's threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe DR Congo's foreign ministry
OL,7,Fsummoned Uganda's envoy to explain the
OL,8,Fremarks, describing them as
OL,9,F"particularly serious" and damaging to
OL,10,Fdiplomatic relations.
OL,12,FThe Ugandan government has yet to
OL,13,Frespond.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
